{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Nirvana, Origin of Fate",
    "steam_appid": 3846280,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D third-person game that will take you on an adventure to an island in strange times. Discover your character's ability to survive and develop a long-term metapsychic story. The game allows you to simulate the character's survival needs and find meaning in adventure, and create a bond with the other characters in the game, to develop their ability to control the elements of the island. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story begins in a camp, where the player will find refuge from the very beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a visually stunning environment, learn to communicate using animistic verbs and interact with non-player characters. You can hunt, fish, and gather. You'll be able to explore the island, learn to control the elements of nature, craft your tools, customize your appearance, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the area and mark your path through the brush and rocks, and look for other camps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Events quickly give the adventure a plot twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player will face the seasons and the elements for an adventure that is as fun as it is educational.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player navigates an island generated by a keyword chosen by the player at the beginning of the game, which provides a number of possible islands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first person mode is available for immersion.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D third-person game that will take you on an adventure to an island in strange times. Discover your character's ability to survive and develop a long-term metapsychic story. The game allows you to simulate the character's survival needs and find meaning in adventure, and create a bond with the other characters in the game, to develop their ability to control the elements of the island. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story begins in a camp, where the player will find refuge from the very beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a visually stunning environment, learn to communicate using animistic verbs and interact with non-player characters. You can hunt, fish, and gather. You'll be able to explore the island, learn to control the elements of nature, craft your tools, customize your appearance, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the area and mark your path through the brush and rocks, and look for other camps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Events quickly give the adventure a plot twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player will face the seasons and the elements for an adventure that is as fun as it is educational.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player navigates an island generated by a keyword chosen by the player at the beginning of the game, which provides a number of possible islands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first person mode is available for immersion.</p>",
